# Agreement Validity Period

This scope determines if a given date falls within the operational period of the trade agreement.
```catala
declaration scope AgreementValidity:
  input check_date content date
  output is_valid content boolean
```
The agreement is valid if the provided date is on or after January 1, 1987, and on or before December 31, 1991.
```catala
scope AgreementValidity:
  date round down
  definition is_valid equals (check_date >= |1987-01-01|) and (check_date <= |1991-12-31|)
```